<title>USA: Asset Guaranty has capacity for NYC YMCA bonds.</title>
<headline>Asset Guaranty has capacity for NYC YMCA bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Guaranty Insurance Co said Tuesday it has secondary market insurance capacity for New York City Industrial Development Agency civil facilities revenue bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity for the bonds, sold for the YMCA of Greater New York project, is limited and available on a first-come, first-served basis, Asset Guaranty said.</p>
<p>For more information, call 212-984-9288.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
